/** ความครอบคลุมต่อฟีดเดอร์ตามชนิดการตรวจ ในช่วงปีที่เลือก: อุปกรณ์ที่ตรวจแล้ว ÷ อุปกรณ์ที่ต้องตรวจ (ตามระดับความสำคัญ) */
function apiCoverage(token, f) {
  auth_(token, 'view'); f = f || {};
  const type = f.type || 'ลาดตระเวน', days = +f.days || 365, since = Date.now() - days * 86400000;
  const fq = INSP_FREQ[type] || [1, 1, 1];
  const devs = table_(SH.DEVICES).rows.filter(d => !devRetired_(d) && d.feeder && !/มิเตอร์|meter/i.test(String(d.kind)));
  const done = {}, last = {};
  table_(SH.INSP).rows.forEach(r => {
    if (String(r.type) !== type) return; const t = r.date instanceof Date ? r.date.getTime() : Date.parse(r.date); if (!(t >= since)) return;
    String([r.device, r.devices].filter(Boolean).join(',')).split(/[,\s]+/).filter(Boolean).forEach(c => { const k = deviceKey_(c); done[k] = (done[k] || 0) + 1; if (!last[k] || t > last[k]) last[k] = t; });
  });
  const by = {};
  devs.forEach(d => {
    const crit = [1, 2, 3].indexOf(+d.crit) >= 0 ? +d.crit : 3, need = fq[crit - 1]; if (!need) return;
    const k = deviceKey_(d.code), F = by[d.feeder] || (by[d.feeder] = { feeder: String(d.feeder), total: 0, ok: 0, devices: [] });
    const n = done[k] || 0, ok = n >= Math.max(1, Math.round(need * days / 365));
    F.total++; if (ok) F.ok++;
    if (f.feeder === d.feeder) F.devices.push({ code: String(d.code), kind: String(d.kind), crit, need, n, ok, last: last[k] ? fmtDate_(new Date(last[k])) : '', lat: d.lat === '' ? '' : +d.lat, lon: d.lon === '' ? '' : +d.lon, tambon: String(d.tambon || '') });
  });
  const feeders = Object.values(by).map(F => Object.assign(F, { pct: F.total ? Math.round(F.ok / F.total * 1000) / 10 : 0 })).sort((a, b) => a.pct - b.pct);
  feeders.forEach(F => { if (F.feeder !== f.feeder) delete F.devices; else F.devices.sort((a, b) => a.ok - b.ok || a.crit - b.crit || a.code.localeCompare(b.code)); });
  return { type, days, types: Object.keys(INSP_FREQ), freq: INSP_FREQ, feeders };
}
